  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy dãy số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là một cấp số cộng với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và công sai <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Công thức của cấp số cộng: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> là công sai.<br>Tìm công sai <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math>: Từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></semantics></math>:\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">và</mtext><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Lấy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>:\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br>Tìm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>: Từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, thay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>:\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br>Tìm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>8</mn></msub></semantics></math>: Sử dụng công thức <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>:\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br></li><li>Công thức tổng của cấp số nhân lùi vô hạn:<br>Nếu cấp số nhân có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, tổng của cấp số nhân lùi vô hạn là \n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>\n\t\t\ttrong đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math> là số hạng đầu tiên và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>q</mi></semantics></math> là công bội.<br>Xác định <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>q</mi></semantics></math>:<br>- Số hạng đầu tiên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>- Công bội <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> (tìm được từ tỷ số giữa hai số hạng liên tiếp, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>Tính tổng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>S</mi></semantics></math>: Áp dụng công thức:\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>7</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br></li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⇔</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⇔</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
